---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="法定声明与主体信息 (Impressum) | EU DPP Provider"
  description="根据德国《数字服务法》(DDG) 第 5 条与欧盟电商指令 2000/31/EC 第 5 条所载明的法定提供商声明与合规主体信息。"
>
  <div class="py-16 sm:py-24 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="eyebrow-pill mb-3 mx-auto">法定主体与合规声明</div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        法定声明 <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="text-cyan-600">(Legal Notice / Impressum)</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        根据德国《数字服务法》(DDG) 第 5 条及欧盟指令 2000/31/EC 第 5 条之规定公开的法定主体信息与运营规范。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-xl bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">1</span>
          <span>服务提供商与主体信息</span>
        </h2>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <div>
            <div class="text-slate-400 font-mono uppercase text-xs mb-1">品牌标识</div>
            <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base">EU DPP Provider</div>
            <div class="text-slate-500 mt-1">企业级欧盟电池数字产品护照与主权数据托管服务商</div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="text-slate-400 font-mono uppercase text-xs mb-1">主体信息与登记</div>
            <div class="font-bold text-slate-900">南京宁伊文化传播有限公司 / EU DPP Provider</div>
            <div class="text-slate-500 mt-0.5">统一社会信用代码：<span class="font-mono text-slate-700 font-bold">913201025685882797</span></div>
            <div class="text-slate-500">法定代表人：<span class="text-slate-800 font-medium">朱民</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-xl bg-green-100 text-green-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">2</span>
          <span>联系方式与机房节点</span>
        </h2>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <div>
            <div class="text-slate-400 font-mono uppercase text-xs mb-1">官方业务与合规对接邮箱</div>
            <div class="font-bold text-cyan-700 font-mono text-base">
              <a href="mailto:info@eudppprovider.com">info@eudppprovider.com</a>
            </div>
            <div class="text-slate-500 mt-1">响应时限：24 个工作小时内答复</div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="text-slate-400 font-mono uppercase text-xs mb-1">欧洲主权云机房节点</div>
            <div class="text-slate-800 font-medium">德国法兰克福 & 慕尼黑 ISO/IEC 27001 认证机房</div>
            <div class="text-slate-500 mt-0.5">eIDAS 2.0 数字印章认证机构：DigiCert EU / D-Trust</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
